## 技术实现

### 后端实现 (Rust)

#### 1. 数据结构定义

**文件**: `src-tauri/src/lib.rs`

```rust
use serde::{Serialize, Deserialize};

/// Region capture parameters
#[derive(Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]
struct RegionParams {
    x: i32,
    y: i32,
    width: u32,
    height: u32,
}

/// Screenshot result structure (reuse existing)
#[derive(Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]
struct ScreenshotResult {
    success: bool,
    path: Option<String>,
    error: Option<String>,
}

/// Monitor bounds for validation
struct MonitorBounds {
    width: u32,
    height: u32,
}
```

#### 2. 坐标验证与调整

```rust
/// Validate and clamp region coordinates to monitor bounds
fn validate_and_clamp_region(
    x: i32,
    y: i32,
    width: u32,
    height: u32,
    monitor_bounds: &MonitorBounds,
) -> Result<(i32, i32, u32, u32), String> {
    // Minimum region size
    const MIN_WIDTH: u32 = 50;
    const MIN_HEIGHT: u32 = 50;

    // Validate dimensions
    if width < MIN_WIDTH || height < MIN_HEIGHT {
        return Err(format!(
            "Region too small. Minimum size: {}x{}",
            MIN_WIDTH, MIN_HEIGHT
        ));
    }

    // Clamp coordinates to monitor bounds
    let clamped_x = x.max(0).min((monitor_bounds.width as i32) - (width as i32));
    let clamped_y = y.max(0).min((monitor_bounds.height as i32) - (height as i32));

    // Ensure region fits within monitor
    let max_width = (monitor_bounds.width as i32 - clamped_x) as u32;
    let max_height = (monitor_bounds.height as i32 - clamped_y) as u32;
    let final_width = width.min(max_width);
    let final_height = height.min(max_height);

    // Log if coordinates were adjusted
    if clamped_x != x || clamped_y != y || final_width != width || final_height != height {
        eprintln!(
            "Region adjusted: ({},{} {}x{}) -> ({},{} {}x{})",
            x, y, width, height,
            clamped_x, clamped_y, final_width, final_height
        );
    }

    Ok((clamped_x, clamped_y, final_width, final_height))
}
```

#### 3. 默认区域计算

```rust
/// Calculate default centered region
fn calculate_default_region(monitor_width: u32, monitor_height: u32) -> (i32, i32, u32, u32) {
    // Default region size: 800x600 or 50% of screen, whichever is smaller
    let default_width = 800u32.min(monitor_width / 2);
    let default_height = 600u32.min(monitor_height / 2);

    // Center the region
    let x = ((monitor_width as i32) - (default_width as i32)) / 2;
    let y = ((monitor_height as i32) - (default_height as i32)) / 2;

    (x, y, default_width, default_height)
}
```

#### 4. 区域截图命令

```rust
/// Capture a specific region of the screen
#[tauri::command]
fn capture_screen_region(x: i32, y: i32, width: u32, height: u32) -> Result<ScreenshotResult, String> {
    // Get all monitors
    let monitors = Monitor::all()
        .map_err(|e| format!("Failed to get monitors: {}", e))?;

    // Find primary monitor
    let primary_monitor = monitors
        .into_iter()
        .find(|m| m.is_primary().unwrap_or(false))
        .ok_or_else(|| "No primary monitor found".to_string())?;

    // Get monitor dimensions
    let monitor_width = primary_monitor.width()
        .map_err(|e| format!("Failed to get monitor width: {}", e))?;
    let monitor_height = primary_monitor.height()
        .map_err(|e| format!("Failed to get monitor height: {}", e))?;

    let monitor_bounds = MonitorBounds {
        width: monitor_width,
        height: monitor_height,
    };

    // Validate and clamp coordinates
    let (final_x, final_y, final_width, final_height) = 
        validate_and_clamp_region(x, y, width, height, &monitor_bounds)?;

    // Capture region
    let image = primary_monitor
        .capture_region(final_x, final_y, final_width, final_height)
        .map_err(|e| format!("Failed to capture region: {}", e))?;

    // Generate filename with timestamp and "region" identifier
    let timestamp = Local::now().format("%Y%m%d_%H%M%S").to_string();
    let filename = format!("screenshot_region_{}.png", timestamp);

    // Get download directory
    let download_dir = get_download_dir()
        .ok_or_else(|| "Failed to get download directory".to_string())?;

    let file_path = download_dir.join(&filename);

    // Save image
    image.save(&file_path)
        .map_err(|e| format!("Failed to save screenshot: {}", e))?;

    Ok(ScreenshotResult {
        success: true,
        path: Some(file_path.to_string_lossy().to_string()),
        error: None,
    })
}
```

#### 5. 命令注册

